            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cookingfrenzy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't quite use the recipe provided here because I didn't have pears or vanilla yogurt. Instead, I used strawberry yogurt and the blueberry sauce recipe (although THAT turned out to be a fruit medley sauce) I also found on allrecipes. The smoothies turned out wonderful, refreshing, and delicious!",
            "datePublished": "2012-07-07T18:53:54.447Z"
          },
          {
